    "updated_at": "2016-05-09T00:29:24Z",
    "body": "And throughout the discussion, I forgot this one... What about [getOutputMedia()](https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-screen-share/)?  I'm OK with:\n1. using the same flag\n2. denying it unconditionally\n3. adding a new flag\n\nWith my preference being roughly that order.\n",
