    "updated_at": "2016-05-09T16:23:35Z",
    "body": "I guess you mean getDisplayMedia. Using the same flag seems reasonable to me, assuming there are no use cases for sandboxing user media separately from display media. (E.g., a screensharing service that you don't want to allow to spy on you via webcam?)\n",
